  <ferc:NotesToFinancialStatementsTextBlock id="HHFB845F6A13C048AB10E053139FD9FDD6" contextRef="HH6F430EA68AFC29D1DD829B0DDD45FFF4">&lt;div&gt;&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-weight: bold;"&gt;The Company&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;Mid-America Pipeline Company, LLC (&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;&amp;#8220;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;Mid-America&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;&amp;#8221;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;) is a Texas limited liability company and a wholly owned subsidiary of Mapletree, LLC, a Delaware limited liability company. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;Mapletree,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt; LLC is a wholly owned subsidiary of Enterprise Products Operating LLC (EPOLLC), a Texas limited liability company. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;EPOLLC in turn is wholly&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;owned by Enterprise Products Partners L.P., &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;a Delaware limited partnership, which is &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;a publicly traded partnership&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; -aw-import: spaces;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;EPOLLC is the operator of the Mid-America pipeline system.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-weight: bold;"&gt;Description of the Property&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;Mid-America owns a natural gas liquids (&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;&amp;#8220;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;NGL&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;&amp;#8221;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;) pipeline system that is approximately 7,8&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;3&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;0 miles in length. It consists of three primary systems: the approximately 3,000-mile Rocky Mountain System, the approximately 2,800-mile Northern system and the approximately 2,0&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;3&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;0-mile Central System. Mid-America's operations cover thirteen states: Wyoming, Utah, Colorado, New Mexico, Texas, Oklahoma, Kansas, Missouri, Nebraska, Iowa, Illinois, Minnesota, and Wisconsin. The Rocky Mountain System transports mixed natural gas liquids from the Rocky Mountain Overthrust and San Juan Basin areas to the Hobbs hub, located on the Texas/New Mexico border. The Northern system links the NGL hub at Conway, Kansas to refineries, petrochemical plants, and propane markets in the upper Midwest. The Central System connects the Conway hub with Kansas refineries and transports NGLs between Conway, Kansas, and the Hobbs Hub.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt; Starting in January 2024, Mid-America leased certain pipeline capacity to its &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;affiliate, Enterprise TW Products Pipeline Company, LLC, for refined products transportation service originating in Hobbs, Texas and delivering to terminal locations in New Mexico, and Utah.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-weight: bold;"&gt;Basis of Accounting&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;The accounting policies followed in preparation of these financial statements conform to those required by FERC. Financial statements are prepared on &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;the accrual&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt; basis of accounting.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt; Property, plant and equipment assets are recorded at original cost.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-weight: bold;"&gt;Revenue Recognition&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;Mid-America's revenues are primarily derived from transportation of natural gas liquids under intrastate and interstate tariffs. The tariffs specify the amounts to be paid by shippers for service between receipt and delivery locations and the general terms and conditions of transportation services on the pipeline system. Revenues are recognized upon delivery of products to customers.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-weight: bold;"&gt;Income Taxes&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;Mid-America is a limited liability company that passes income tax liability through the company to &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;EPOLLC&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt; and&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;with the exception of&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt; the Texas Franchise Tax&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;, if applicable,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt; does not recognize this liability on Mid-America's financial statements.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;For purposes of calculating income taxes for the annual cost of service (shown on page 700 of the Annual Report), Mid-America employs FERC's Policy Statement on Income Tax Allowances.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-weight: bold;"&gt;Employees&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;Mid-America has no employees of its own. All operations, management, and administrative functions are performed by employees of Enterprise Products Company on behalf of EPOLLC, the operator.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; -aw-import: spaces;"&gt;&amp;#160; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;Mid-America reimburses &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;EPOLLC for management and administrative functions under the terms of an &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;operating agreement&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 8pt; font-size: 8pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</ferc:NotesToFinancialStatementsTextBlock>
